    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.3.4.6",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.3.4.6",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἐοικεν.",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.3.5",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.3.5",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἦν ἄρα καὶ πρὸ κόσμου πάντῃ ἀπροσδεὴς ὢν καὶ πατὴρ καὶ παντοκράτωρ καὶ δημιουργός, ὅπως αὐτὸς δι᾿ ἑαυτόν ἀλλὰ μὴ ετερον ταυτα ῃ;",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.3.5.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.3.5.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἀνάγκη.",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.3.6",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.3.6",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Εἰ γὰρ διὰ κόσμον καὶ οὐχὶ δι᾿ ἑαυτόν, ἕτερος ὢν κόσμου, παντοκράτωρ τοκράτωρ γνωρίζοιτο συγγνώμῃ ὁ θεός ἀναγκάζομαι γὰρ τοῦτο εἰπεῖν), αὐτὸς καθ᾿ ἑαυτὸν ἀτελὴς ἔσται καὶ προσδεὴς τούτων, ἃ παντοκράτωρ καὶ δημιουργός ἐστιν.",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.3.6.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.3.6.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "῾Υπερφυῶς.",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.3.6.2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.3.6.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὖκ ἄρα ἀποδεκτέον ταύτην τὴν ὀλέθριον ἁμαρτίαν τῶν λεγόντων παντοκράτορα εἶναι καὶ δημιουργὸν διὰ τὰ κρατούμενα καὶ δημιουργούμενα τρεπτά, ἀλλ’ οὐ δι᾿ ἑαυτὸν εἶναι τὸν θεόν.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ὅρα δὲ καὶ ὧδε. εἰ ὕστερον, ἔφης, πεποίηται ὁ κόσμος, πρότερον ὤν, μεταβάλλειν ἀνάγκη τὸν ἀπαθῆ καὶ ἀναλλοίωτον θεόν·",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὸν γὰρ ποιοῦντα πρότερον μηδέν, ὕστερον δέ, ἀπὸ τοῦ μὴ ποιεῖν εἰς τὸ Ποιεῖν μεταβάλλειν καὶ ἀλλοιοῦσθαι ἀνάγκη.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἔλεγον γάρ.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Πέπαυται δὲ τοῦ ποιεῖν ποτε τὸν κόσμον ὁ θεός, ἢ οὔ;",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Πέπαυται.",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.5",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.5",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὔπω γὰρ ἦν τετελειωμένος ἄν.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
