    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.6",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.1.6",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἀληθές.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Εἰ οὐν τὸ ποιεῖν ἐκ τοῦ μὴ ποιεῖν ἀλλοίωσιν τοῦ θεοῦ καταψηφίζεται, οὐχὶ καὶ τὸ μὴ ποιεῖν ἐκ τοῦ ποιεῖν;",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.2.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.2.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἀνάγκη.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.2.2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.2.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἠλλοιῶσθαι δὲ αὐτὸν φαίης μὴ ποιοῦντα σήμερον παρ' ὃ ὅτε ἐποίει;",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.2.3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.2.3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὐδαμῶς.",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.4.2.4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.4.2.4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὐδ' ἄρα ὅτ’ ἐποίει τὸν κόσμον, ἠλλοιῶσθαι αὐτὸν ἀνάγκη παρ ὃ ἠν ὅτε οὐκ ἐποίει· καὶ οὔτε ἀνάγκη συνυπάρχειν αὐτῷ τὸ πᾶν δεῖν λέγειν διὰ τὸ μὴ ἀναγκάζεσθαι λέγειν ἠλλοιῶσθαι, οὔτε συναΐδιον δι᾿ αὐτὸ τοῦτο.",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.5.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.5.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καί μοι φαθὶ καὶ ὧδε. γενητὸν τὸ μὴ γενέσεως ἔχον ἀρχὴν φαίης ἄν;",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.5.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.5.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὐ δῆτα· εἰ γὰρ μὴ ὑποπίπτει γενέσεως ἀρχῇ, ἐξ ἀνάγκης ἀγένητόν ἐστιν.",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.5.1.2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.5.1.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Εἰ δὲ γέγονεν, ὑπὸ αἰτίου τινὸς δίδως αὐτὸ γεγονέναι· πάντῃ γὰρ ἀδύνατον χωρὶς αἰτίου γένεσιν ἔχειν;",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.5.1.3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.5.1.3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἀδύνατον.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.5.2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.5.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Κόσμον δὴ οὖν, καὶ ὅσα ἐν αὐτῷ μῶν ἄλλου τινὸς ἢ θεοῦ δημιουργοῦντος φήσομεν γεγονέναι ὕστερον, πρότερον οὐκ ὄντα;",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg005.5.2.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg005/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg005.5.2.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Δῆλον ὅτι θεοῦ.",
